# tuwing, "every time".  The rival mechanism -- reduplicating the unit noun
# (araw-araw, buwan-buwan, taon-taon) -- is not shipped: it is a closed set of
# derived adverbs rather than a marker, linggo-linggo has no entry at all, and
# nothing sources whether the two are interchangeable.  en.wiktionary.org, tuwing.
tuwing
